 12345678901234567890.123456789 | ok                                             | ok                                                    | t
                                | 38000: plzig function failed: InvalidCharacter | 22P02: invalid input syntax for type numeric: ""      | 
                                | 38000: plzig function failed: InvalidCharacter | 22P02: invalid input syntax for type numeric: " "     | 
